---
Log in with your email address and a login code or password, and save the login.
It prints the account and its workspaces. The login goes to the keychain, or to --home.

USAGE
  holst auth login [flags]

FLAGS
  --email address   The email address to log in with; asked for when missing
  --no-save         Only check that the login works; do not save the login

INHERITED FLAGS
  --output, --verbose, --base-url, --home, --no-cache, --help   as in `holst -h`

EXAMPLES
  $ holst auth login
  $ holst auth login --email you@example.com
  $ holst auth login --no-save

LEARN MORE
  Exit codes: `holst help exit-codes`.
